  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Covenant for Renewable Energy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The work of civil society organisations in the Covenant is supported by the Subsidy programme Sectorale Samenwerking IMVO 2022-2025, second pillar: civil society organisations in the Covenant at the Rijksdienst voor Ondernemend Nederland (RVO), which was approved to
the Parties on the 14th of July 2023. They aim to contribute their knowledge, expertise, (international) network and experience to contribute to a more sustainable value chain in metals, minerals and materials
necessary for the development of renewable energy sources, that limits harms to biodiversity,
climate change, vulnerable communities, and human rights.</narrative>
  </description>
